# Components used

Preprocessing - Loading and normalizing features (Time, Speed, Altitude) using StandardScaler.

Clustering - KMeans for unsupervised flight phase identification.

Evaluation - Elbow Method + Silhouette Score for optimal k.

Visualization - 3D scatter plot to visualize clustered flight data.

LSTM Model - Predicting temporal flight phase transitions using an LSTM network.

Interaction	- User inputs cluster count and custom names; training metrics visualized.
